{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55966","headline":"寄黄损 · 廖匡图","name":"寄黄损","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庄周指我悟荣生，买得衡山十里青。\n却许野禽栖竹径，不教凡客扣柴扃。\n横琴独坐泉围石，倚棹长吟月满汀。\n珍重零陵旧知己，菱花时把照星星。\n（周本淳校点本《诗话总龟》卷二八引《雅言系述》。\n《南岳总胜集》卷中「兜率寺」条引「买得衡州十里青」一句，谓廖处士作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"廖匡图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}